  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.3', 'Marketing Mix & Strategy', 'What is above-the-line promotion?', 'Promotion through mass media such as TV, radio, cinema and online display advertising.', 5),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.3', 'Marketing Mix & Strategy', 'What is below-the-line promotion?', 'Promotion not using mass media, e.g. sales promotions, direct mail, public relations and sponsorship.', 6),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.3', 'Marketing Mix & Strategy', 'What is viral marketing?', 'Marketing that spreads rapidly through social media sharing.', 7),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.3', 'Marketing Mix & Strategy', 'What is social media marketing?', 'Using platforms such as Instagram and TikTok to promote products and engage customers.', 8),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.3', 'Marketing Mix & Strategy', 'What is influencer marketing?', 'Paying individuals with a large online following to promote products.', 9),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.3', 'Marketing Mix & Strategy', 'What is price skimming?', 'Launching a new product at a high price to maximise revenue from early adopters, then reducing it over time.', 10),
