  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is a zero-hours contract?', 'A contract where the employer doesn''t guarantee a minimum number of hours.', 4),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is multi-skilling?', 'Training workers in several skills so they can perform different tasks, increasing flexibility.', 5),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is outsourcing in HR?', 'Using external firms to carry out tasks previously done in-house, e.g. payroll.', 6),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is induction training?', 'Training for new staff to introduce them to the business, its procedures and colleagues.', 7),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is on-the-job training?', 'Training while working, e.g. shadowing experienced staff.', 8),
