  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is decentralisation?', 'Decision-making authority passed down to lower levels or branches.', 13),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is Taylor''s view of motivation?', 'Workers are motivated by money; work should be broken into simple tasks with piece-rate pay (scientific management).', 14),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is Mayo''s view of motivation?', 'Workers are motivated by social factors, teamwork and attention from managers (Hawthorne effect).', 15),
