  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is job rotation?', 'Moving workers between different tasks to reduce boredom.', 19),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is an autocratic leadership style?', 'The leader makes decisions alone, with little input from staff.', 20),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is a democratic leadership style?', 'The leader involves staff in decision-making.', 21),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.4', 'Managing People', 'What is a laissez-faire leadership style?', 'The leader gives staff freedom to make decisions with minimal guidance.', 22),
  ('Business Studies', 'Edexcel', 'alevel', '1.5', 'Entrepreneurs & Leaders', 'What is enterprise?', 'The willingness and ability to take risks to start and run a business.', 1),
